\ls14\ilvl0\cf11 \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 		\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
Keyboard input\cf5 : Type text and use keyboard shortcuts\
\ls14\ilvl0\cf11 \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 		\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
Desktop automation\cf5 : Interact with any application or interface\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa400\partightenfactor0
