\fs40 \cf16 \uc0\u8203 \cf6 \
\
\cf16 Optimize model performance with prompting\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa400\partightenfactor0

\fs32 \cf5 Here are some tips on how to get the best quality outputs:\
\pard\tx220\tx720\pardeftab720\li720\fi-720\sa160\partightenfactor0
\ls24\ilvl0\cf5 \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 {\listtext	1	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
Specify simple, well-defined tasks and provide explicit instructions for each step.\
\ls24\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 {\listtext	2	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
Claude sometimes assumes outcomes of its actions without explicitly checking their results. To prevent this you can prompt Claude with 
\fs28 \cf16 \cb17 After each step, take a screenshot and carefully evaluate if you have achieved the right outcome. Explicitly show your thinking: "I have evaluated step X..." If not correct, try again. Only when you confirm a step was executed correctly should you move on to the next one.
\fs32 \cf5 \cb1 \
\ls24\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 {\listtext	3	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
Some UI elements (like dropdowns and scrollbars) might be tricky for Claude to manipulate using mouse movements. If you experience this, try prompting the model to use keyboard shortcuts.\
\ls24\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 {\listtext	4	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
For repeatable tasks or UI interactions, include example screenshots and tool calls of successful outcomes in your prompt.\
\ls24\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 {\listtext	5	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
If you need the model to log in, provide it with the username and password in your prompt inside xml tags like 
\fs28 \cf16 \cb17 <robot_credentials>
\fs32 \cf5 \cb1 . Using computer use within applications that require login increases the risk of bad outcomes as a result of prompt injection. Please review our {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://docs.anthropic.com/en/docs/test-and-evaluate/strengthen-guardrails/mitigate-jailbreaks"}}{\fldrslt \cf16 guide on mitigating prompt injections}} before providing the model with login credentials.\
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\cf21 \
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\cf22 \cb23 If you repeatedly encounter a clear set of issues or know in advance the tasks Claude will need to complete, use the system prompt to provide Claude with explicit tips or instructions on how to do the tasks successfully.\cb1 \
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0

