\ls27\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 {\listtext	2	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
Identify potential issues or misconceptions\
\ls27\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 {\listtext	3	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
Learn from Claude\'92s approach to problem-solving\
\ls27\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 {\listtext	4	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
Get more visibility into complex multi-step operations\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa400\partightenfactor0
\cf5 Here\'92s an example of what thinking output might look like:\
